# ============================================
# Simple iOS To-Do App — Environment Variables
# ============================================
#
# This app runs entirely on-device with local SQLite storage.
# No backend server, no cloud database, no API keys required.
#
# This file exists for monorepo convention only.
# You do NOT need to create a .env file to run this app.
#
# ============================================

# No environment variables are required.
# The app has zero external dependencies.

# If you ever extend this app to include cloud sync or push
# notifications in the future, you would add keys here:
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here